# Astryx (Cursor mirror of rules/01-astryx.md)

> Canonical source: `rules/01-astryx.md`. If they differ, canonical wins.
> Source: https://github.com/meta/astryx · Docs: https://astryx.atmeta.com

- React 19+ · `@astryxdesign/core` · themes via `@astryxdesign/theme-*` · StyleX invisible.
- Install: `npm i @astryxdesign/core @astryxdesign/theme-neutral @stylexjs/stylex` + `npm i -D @astryxdesign/cli`
- Discover FIRST (every task):
  - `npx @astryxdesign/cli search <q>`
  - `npx @astryxdesign/cli component <Name>`
  - `npx @astryxdesign/cli docs <topic>`
  - `npx @astryxdesign/cli template --list`
- Never run bare `astryx` via npx (unrelated package). Use scoped `@astryxdesign/cli`.
- Use documented props/tokens only. Customize via theme tokens / `className` / swizzle — never fork source.
- Prefer Astryx templates for page layouts. Never hand-write an Astryx component.
- Cite the CLI command + result in your response.
